ghostty (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/rules: drop the vendored libghostty-vt artifacts from the
    package (static/shared lib, pkg-config files, headers) like the RPM
    recipe does; dh_strip fails on the zig-generated 1.4.0 archive
    (embedded .o member paths) and the application does not need them.

 -- Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:02 +0000

ghostty (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depends: add libfreetype-dev and libfontconfig-dev (freetype2.pc
    and fontconfig.pc are required by the zig build on current Debian).
  * debian/rules: run zig build from the package root, not src/
    (zig 0.17 cannot resolve src/build/main.zig relative to src/).

 -- Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:50:00 +0000

